The [[Wooden Sword]] is a starting item for [[Ranger]]. It is also available in the shop for all other classes, at common rarity. It deals very low damage relative to its stamina cost, so using it later than very early in the game may not be recommended. There are a number of crafts possible which make the [[Wooden Sword]] substantially more viable, including some early-game slight upgrades ([[Boomerang]], [[Hero Sword]], [[Shell Totem]], and [[Torch]]), and even a late-game powerful weapon, the [[Prismatic Sword]].

Beyond these single-step crafts, the [[Wooden Sword]] is the beginning of a long crafting tree with many powerful options.

